Error [E0112]: `pow` needs Float or F32, not Decimal (an exact base-10 number)
  --> tests/ui/core_math_float_type_mismatch.jet:7:14
    |
  7 |     math.pow(2.0, F32.from_float(2.0) ?? F32.from_int(0))
    |              ^^^
 Why: pow operates on floating-point numbers
 Fix: pass a Float or F32 base
