Error [E0112]: `hypot` needs all arguments to have the same float type
  --> tests/ui/core_math_float_type_mismatch.jet:8:25
    |
  8 |     math.hypot(2.0, F32.from_float(2.0) ?? F32.from_int(0))
    |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: D-FLOATW1: mixing float widths is not allowed
 Fix: convert the arguments to the same float width
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
